INSTALL (Darwin ARM64 / Apple Silicon)
=======================================

This repository is currently developed with macOS ARM64 and Homebrew Readline.

1) Build
--------

From repository root:

make clean
make MYCFLAGS='-std=c99 -DLUA_USE_POSIX -DLUA_USE_DLOPEN -DLUA_READLINELIB="\"/opt/homebrew/opt/readline/lib/libreadline.dylib\""' MYLDFLAGS="" MYLIBS="" CC=cc


2) Build with a selected default kernel locale
-----------------------------------------------

Use the locale-aware target:

make locale-build LUA_KERNEL_LOCALE='<locale-name>' MYCFLAGS='-std=c99 -DLUA_USE_POSIX -DLUA_USE_DLOPEN -DLUA_READLINELIB="\"/opt/homebrew/opt/readline/lib/libreadline.dylib\""' MYLDFLAGS="" MYLIBS="" CC=cc

`<locale-name>` corresponds to `locale/<locale-name>.lua`.

Examples:
- `LUA_KERNEL_LOCALE=native`
- `LUA_KERNEL_LOCALE=symbolic·transpraxis`

3) Test suite
-------------

cd testes
env -i PATH="$PATH" HOME="$HOME" TERM="$TERM" ../lua main.lua

Expected: output ends with `OK`.


4) Internationalization healthcheck
-----------------------------------

From repository root:

./lua utilitary/internationalization-healthcheck


5) Native locale loading smoke test
-----------------------------------

LUA_LOCALE=native ./lua

Expected: no "failed to load locale" warning.
